  "label": "Meme intent as harmful or provocative",
  "description": "The meme is understood as harmful or provocative because it uses a recognizable political figure in a context that may be interpreted as disrespectful or inflammatory. This requires knowledge of how memes function in online culture — particularly how they can be used to ridicule, polarize, or provoke strong reactions — and how Trump’s image is often weaponized in such contexts.",
